Error [E0316]: Range pattern `100..0` is empty — lower bound exceeds upper bound
  --> tests/ui/range_arm_inverted.jet:4:9
    |
  4 |         100..0 -> { return "impossible" }
    |         ^^^^^^
 Why: The lower end of a range must be ≤ the upper end
 Fix: Swap to `0..100`
